     "monsoon",
     "season",
     "retreat"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Monsoon winds bring most of India's rain. The south-west monsoon arrives from June and the retreating monsoon brings rain to Tamil Nadu in October to December.\nIndia has four main seasons: summer, monsoon, post-monsoon (autumn) and winter.\nFarmers depend on the monsoon, and late or weak rains can harm crops."
    }
